那么三个转移就是
f_{i, j} = 2^{j - i} (f_{i - 1, j - 1} + f_{i - 1, j})
g_{i, j} = g_{i - 1, j - 1} + (2^i - 1) g_{i - 1, j}
h_{i, j} = (2^{i - j} - 1) (h_{i - 1, j} - h{i - 1, j - 1})
接下来计算 h 容斥完的结果 H_i = \sum_{j = 0}^{k - 1} (2^{i - 1 - j} - 1) h_{i - 1, j}
最后就是 ans_i = H_i \sum_{j = i}^n f_{n, j} g_{j, i}
 ans_0 = 2^{\binom{n}{2}} - \sum_{i = 1}^n ans_i

